## Usage hints: what a key does on the control that has the focus.
## JAWS's own words, with its capitals and periods: "Spacebar" in one hint, "spacebar" in another.

hint-activate-enter = To activate press Enter.
hint-check-spacebar = To check press Spacebar.
hint-clear-checkmark-spacebar = To clear checkmark press Spacebar.
hint-move-to-items-arrows = To move to items use the Arrow keys.
hint-toggle-spacebar = To toggle the state press spacebar.
hint-type-in-text = Type in text.
